  "interpretation": "Both lanes now keep live sessions through a graceful stop. On the published RTX 5090 image the EXP-050 workload's stop refused nothing and every stored session resumed from its checkpoint; a reply held out of the response store while another session's admission evicted it was saved first and resumed exactly. The RTX 4090 package passed its 15 canonical phases, including the managed-stop flush of an unpublished session and the OMP 18.2.3 tool call. Automatic checkpoints stay best effort, saving before eviction delays the admitting request, and universal warm reuse is not claimed.",
